<catalogue id="7e98-d50b-da40-11e0" name="EpicAU - Imperial Militia" revision="1" battleScribeVersion="2.03" authorName="EpicAU Horus Heresy (community) - BSData conversion" authorContact="" authorUrl="https://web.archive.org/web/20201111221247/http://epicau.com/mw/index.php/Main_Page" library="false" gameSystemId="5924-e3fb-5543-3044" gameSystemRevision="1" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema">
  <forceEntries>
    <forceEntry id="8149-95da-d7f3-bbe3" name="Imperial Militia" hidden="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="0feb-8c0c-800e-650d" name="Army List" hidden="false">
          <description>Strategy Rating 2. Formation initiative 2+.
2 Support Detachments may be taken per Line Detachment.
Line Detachments may take up to four upgrades, one of each type. Support Detachments may take up to four upgrades, each once.
Up to 1/3 of the army's points may be spent on Allies and/or Lords of War.
When an Imperial Militia (Traitor Militia) army is chosen, at least one detachment must take the Traitors provenance.
Cohesive allies: Legio Titanicus, Legion Astartes, Knight Household.
Disruptive allies: Solar Auxilia, Mechanicum Taghmata, Daemons Of The Ruinstorm (Traitor Militia).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="141c-bb0d-efd3-a493" name="Allies" hidden="false" targetId="d6db-799f-23f8-2194" type="rule"/>
